      "description": "# Back in business baby!\r\n\r\n## Changelog\r\n\r\n- Created an official website for AP Bingo (https://cynichill.github.io/APBingoWeb/)\r\n- The website supports Fog of war, Link copying, Auto-hinting, Player searching, and sending checks!\r\n- The website also changes the tab title to reflect your slotname to help masochists keep track of multiple bingos\r\n\r\n- Expanded max bingo board size from 10x10 to 26x26\r\n- Added Fog of War, a new option where a random square starts revealed, when a square is found, adjacent squares are revealed (Does not affect logic)\r\n- Auto-hinting with fog of war hints squares as they are revealed\r\n- Columns are now letters, and rows are now numbers",
